{"reviews":[{"id":"B00C9J08MU-0","r":5.0,"t":"Nice Tanning Lotion","x":"Been using this for a while now.  Great indoor tanning lotion keeping my skin moist and getting great color from my tanning bed.  I like that this is not a bronzer and just an accelerator.  Great smell too.","h":17,"v":1,"d":"Feb 2017"},{"id":"B00C9J08MU-1","r":5.0,"t":"Best tanning bed lotion deal I found in a long time and I paid full price","x":"Smells good just what I expected it's not too runny the lotion is perfect I don't like the real dark bronzers because sometimes they streak I have my own tanning bed and I have come to learn with as many different tanning lotions that I bought in the past that it's hard to find something that you really really like that's affordable and for the price and the affordability along with the scent and the way the lotion goes on evenly I truly give it five stars and I highly recommend it for the profe","h":5,"v":1,"d":"Oct 2017"},{"id":"B00C9J08MU-2","r":5.0,"t":"Early days yet...","x":"I just used this lotion the first time today, but when they say it eliminates the \"tanning bed\" smell, it DOES!!!  I've been using various Ed Hardy lotions for a few years & they're top-quality lotions.  This one does not disappoint in any way.","h":5,"v":1,"d":"Jun 2019"},{"id":"B00C9J08MU-3","r":5.0,"t":"Good product !","x":"Love this tanning lotion, seems to work well and also smells awesome and leaves your skin feeling soft.","h":4,"v":1,"d":"Oct 2018"},{"id":"B00C9J08MU-4","r":3.0,"t":"Knockoff product?","x":"I just got this today and it\u2019s not the same as the picture on Amazon posted, there is no Ed Hardy logo on bottle or cap, wondering if I just paid money for a knockoff product, I guess time will tell.","h":3,"v":1,"d":"Mar 2019"},{"id":"B00C9J08MU-5","r":3.0,"t":"Knockoff product?","x":"I just got this today and it\u2019s not the same as the picture on Amazon posted, there is no Ed Hardy logo on bottle or cap, wondering if I just paid money for a knockoff product, I guess time will tell.","h":3,"v":1,"d":"Mar 2019"},{"id":"B00C9J08MU-6","r":5.0,"t":"Best Indoor Tanning Lotion","x":"I buy this product regularly for indoor tanning. I\u2019ve used a lot of tanning lotions over the years, and this is a consistent favorite. It keeps my skin smooth, moisturized and supple. Some lotions are noticeably chemical-ridden, but this one is very creamy and natural feeling. It does not irritate my skin and does not turn my skin orange. The smell is not overwhelming.","h":2,"v":1,"d":"Jan 2020"},{"id":"B00C9J08MU-7","r":1.0,"t":"Lacked Ed Hardy Trademarks","x":"The lotions I received had no Ed Hardy trademarks. I have not and will not use because I am unsure of the authenticity.","h":2,"v":1,"d":"Jun 2019"},{"id":"B00C9J08MU-8","r":5.0,"t":"Five Stars","x":"buttery softness and amazingly great smell, super smooth skin and a great golden glow","h":2,"v":1,"d":"Jun 2017"},{"id":"B00C9J08MU-9","r":1.0,"t":"One Star","x":"Did not work as thought as far as tanning. See no difference using this product.","h":2,"v":1,"d":"Oct 2017"},{"id":"B00C9J08MU-10","r":5.0,"t":"Soft skin, no orange effect, and smells great :)","x":"This is my second time purchasing Coconut Kisses, and I was definitely not disappointed.  The scent seems more like vanilla than coconut to me, but I like it.  The pluses for this product are no \"orange\" discoloration, it doesn't stink after you tan, and it makes your skin soft.  The two pack is a great deal.","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Mar 2020"},{"id":"B00C9J08MU-11","r":5.0,"t":"The perfect tanning lotion","x":"The perfect indoor tanning lotion for both men and women. Scent is pleasant without being too girly. My roommate loves it too, and she agrees the scent is nuetral. This lotion seems to do its job well nourishing, keeping the skin healthy through tanning sessions. I have tried many and this one is my favorite.","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Aug 2019"},{"id":"B00C9J08MU-12","r":2.0,"t":"It smells good and makes your skin soft","x":"It smells good and makes your skin soft. Although it doesn't accelerate your tan, unless I suppose you have very light skin and are going for a very light color. It literally is golden. Not my favorite product.","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Mar 2016"},{"id":"B00C9J08MU-13","r":3.0,"t":"No signature on cap as advertised by the seller","x":"Product is not as advertised. Neither bottle has the Ed Hardy signature on the cap as shown in the photo by the seller. Is this a fake? I feel like it did not get what I paid for.","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Mar 2019"},{"id":"B00C9J08MU-14","r":5.0,"t":"Good for men and woman","x":"My husband and me both use these for indoor tanning. The scent isn't overwhelming and is nice for man or woman. We have alot of tattoos and use it to protect our artwork.","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Oct 2019"},{"id":"B00C9J08MU-15","r":1.0,"t":"Not ed hardy","x":"This is not ed hardy, it's tanovations. Take ed hardy pictures and name off product description if you're going to sell a different product.","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Apr 2019"},{"id":"B00C9J08MU-16","r":4.0,"t":"Love the bronzing and color that this product gives me","x":"Love the bronzing and color that this product gives me... my 1st time ever in a fake-N-bake bed and I love the end results.","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Apr 2017"},{"id":"B00C9J08MU-17","r":1.0,"t":"Knock off lotion","x":"Do not buy, it is NOT the Ed hardy lotion. Pissed that I spent money in a knock off","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Apr 2019"},{"id":"B00C9J08MU-18","r":1.0,"t":"Not Ed Hardy","x":"Is not Ed Hardy! It\u2019s a knock off! Sending back for a refund","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Apr 2019"},{"id":"B00C9J08MU-19","r":5.0,"t":"Really like it","x":"Can't see a difference but it smells heavenly","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Apr 2017"},{"id":"B00C9J08MU-20","r":5.0,"t":"Best Smelling Stuff in the Universe","x":"Not sure if this stuff really works for tanning.  I've used it a couple times in a tanning bed, and I did get burned a little.  But this stuff is the best smelling stuff you will ever find.  I just rub it on myself and enjoy the smell all day.  Seriously, I will keep buying this stuff for the rest of my life just for the smell.  It's a little pricey, but like I said, the best smelling stuff in the universe.","h":0,"v":1,"d":"Apr 2020"},{"id":"B00C9J08MU-21","r":5.0,"t":"Weird scent, but very worth it!!","x":"The smell is almost like playdoh, but this stuff WORKS. I thought I hit a tanning plateau when I switched lotions, but nope.. just needed to order more of this one. If you want a rich, golden tan, this is definitely an excellent choice! No bronzer or tingle, but works just as well","h":0,"v":1,"d":"Mar 2020"},{"id":"B00C9J08MU-22","r":4.0,"t":"Cheap all i can say","x":"Didnt notice a difference between any other tanning lotion had a good smell thow Cap kept cracking and there two pieces to it so the glass plastic looking piece finally just broke off into piece in the tanning room hurt when stepped on bottles are cheap lotion seems to be too","h":0,"v":1,"d":"Jul 2020"},{"id":"B00C9J08MU-23","r":3.0,"t":"dosen't enhance tanning","x":"I have used this product 6 sessions in a stand-up tanning booth and haven't noticed any additional or enhanced tan. I usually tan rather easily, but white areas remained white after all sessions. The only benefit is that it dose leave your skin soft with a pleasant fragrance.","h":0,"v":1,"d":"Aug 2018"},{"id":"B00C9J08MU-24","r":1.0,"t":"Causes breakouts and rash!!","x":"I\u2019ve bought this in the past and was happy. I bought this for myself and a friend and the FIRST TIME we used it we BOTH broke out in a rash all over!! It has taken a week for the rash to fade! Idk what they changed in the formula but DO NOT buy this!","h":0,"v":1,"d":"Apr 2019"}],"emb":"","summary":{"claims":[{"text":"Reviewers frequently praise the pleasant scent, describing it as great, neutral, and not overwhelming.","cites":[1,2,4,9,11,12,13,15]},{"text":"Many reviewers say the lotion leaves skin soft, smooth, and moisturized.","cites":[4,7,9,11,13]},{"text":"Several reviewers question authenticity, noting missing Ed Hardy logos or signatures on the bottle or cap.","cites":[5,6,8,14]},{"text":"Some reviewers report the product did not accelerate or produce a noticeable tan.","cites":[10,13]},{"text":"A few reviewers appreciate that it is not a bronzer and does not cause orange discoloration or streaking.","cites":[1,2,11]}]},"qa":[]}